IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ccc-core`
IMPORT `ccc3-freezing`

-- ccc3-tests-freezing.l4 -- tests of sections 83.08 to 83.12. Expected values are hand-written from the text beside each assertion.
-- Each #TRACE line carries `-- EXPECT <outcome>`, decided from the text before the run and compared by `work/trace_check.py`.

§ `Tests of sections 83.08 to 83.12`

`s 83.08(1) the dealing act` MEANS `s 83.08(1)(a) deals, directly or indirectly, in property that is owned or controlled by or on behalf of a terrorist group`
`s 83.08(1) the transaction act` MEANS `s 83.08(1)(b) enters into or facilitates, directly or indirectly, a transaction in respect of that property`
`s 83.08(1) the services act` MEANS `s 83.08(1)(c) provides financial or other related services in respect of that property to, for the benefit of or at the direction of a terrorist group`
`s 83.08(1) no act of the list` MEANS `s 83.08(1) does none of those things`

-- ---- 83.08(1): in Canada or a Canadian outside Canada; knowingly; property of a terrorist group. Arguments: in Canada, Canadian, act, knowingly, property of the group, group a terrorist group.
#ASSERT `s 83.08(1) the person is barred from the act` TRUE (JUST FALSE) `s 83.08(1) the dealing act` TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- (a), in Canada
#ASSERT `s 83.08(1) the person is barred from the act` TRUE (JUST FALSE) `s 83.08(1) the transaction act` TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- (b)
#ASSERT `s 83.08(1) the person is barred from the act` TRUE (JUST FALSE) `s 83.08(1) the services act` TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- (c)
#ASSERT `s 83.08(1) the person is barred from the act` FALSE (JUST TRUE) `s 83.08(1) the dealing act` TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- a Canadian outside Canada
#ASSERT `s 83.08(1) the person is barred from the act` FALSE (JUST FALSE) `s 83.08(1) the dealing act` TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING   -- outside Canada and not a Canadian: not within the section
#ASSERT `s 83.08(1) the person is barred from the act` FALSE NOTHING `s 83.08(1) the dealing act` TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.08(1) the person is barred from the act` TRUE (JUST FALSE) `s 83.08(1) no act of the list` TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.08(1) the person is barred from the act` TRUE (JUST FALSE) `s 83.08(1) the dealing act` FALSE TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING   -- not knowingly
#ASSERT `s 83.08(1) the person is barred from the act` TRUE (JUST FALSE) `s 83.08(1) the dealing act` TRUE FALSE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING   -- the property is not the group's
#ASSERT `s 83.08(1) the person is barred from the act` TRUE (JUST FALSE) `s 83.08(1) the dealing act` TRUE TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING   -- not a terrorist group
#ASSERT `s 83.08(1) the person is barred from the act` TRUE (JUST FALSE) `s 83.08(1) the dealing act` TRUE TRUE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING   -- whether it is a terrorist group is not determined
#TRACE `s 83.08(1) the prohibition` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the accused` DOES `s 83.08(1)(a) deals, directly or indirectly, in property that is owned or controlled by or on behalf of a terrorist group` AT 1   -- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 83.08(1) the prohibition` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the accused` DOES `s 83.08(1)(b) enters into or facilitates, directly or indirectly, a transaction in respect of that property` AT 1   -- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 83.08(1) the prohibition` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the accused` DOES `s 83.08(1)(c) provides financial or other related services in respect of that property to, for the benefit of or at the direction of a terrorist group` AT 1   -- EXPECT BREACH

-- ---- 83.08(2): an immunity from civil liability.
#ASSERT `s 83.08(2) the person is not liable in the civil action` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.08(2) the person is not liable in the civil action` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- did not take all reasonable steps to satisfy themselves
#ASSERT `s 83.08(2) the person is not liable in the civil action` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- did not act reasonably

-- ---- 83.09.
#ASSERT `s 83.09(1) the Minister or a designated person may authorize the activity or transaction` TRUE (JUST FALSE) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.09(1) the Minister or a designated person may authorize the activity or transaction` FALSE (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- a Canadian outside Canada
#ASSERT `s 83.09(1) the Minister or a designated person may authorize the activity or transaction` FALSE (JUST FALSE) TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.09(1) the Minister or a designated person may authorize the activity or transaction` TRUE (JUST FALSE) FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- not a specified activity or class
#ASSERT `s 83.09(1) the Minister or a designated person may authorize the activity or transaction` TRUE (JUST FALSE) TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- not prohibited by 83.08
#ASSERT `s 83.09(2) the Minister or a designated person may make the authorization subject to terms and conditions` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.09(2) the Minister or a designated person may make the authorization subject to terms and conditions` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.09(2) the Minister or a designated person may amend, suspend, revoke or reinstate the authorization` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.09(2) the Minister or a designated person may amend, suspend, revoke or reinstate the authorization` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.09(3) the rights and interests are entitled to the same ranking` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.09(3) the rights and interests are entitled to the same ranking` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- held by a terrorist group or its agent
#ASSERT `s 83.09(3) the rights and interests are entitled to the same ranking` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.09(4) the other person is not subject to sections 83.08, 83.1 and 83.11` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.09(4) the other person is not subject to sections 83.08, 83.1 and 83.11` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.09(4) the other person is not subject to sections 83.08, 83.1 and 83.11` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.09(4) the other person is not subject to sections 83.08, 83.1 and 83.11` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- the terms or conditions are not met

-- ---- 83.1(1): arguments: in Canada, Canadian, in possession or control, knows, group a terrorist group.
#ASSERT `s 83.1(1)(a) the person must disclose the existence of the property` TRUE (JUST FALSE) TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.1(1)(a) the person must disclose the existence of the property` FALSE (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- a Canadian outside Canada
#ASSERT `s 83.1(1)(a) the person must disclose the existence of the property` FALSE (JUST FALSE) TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.1(1)(a) the person must disclose the existence of the property` FALSE NOTHING TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.1(1)(a) the person must disclose the existence of the property` TRUE (JUST FALSE) FALSE TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING   -- not in their possession or control
#ASSERT `s 83.1(1)(a) the person must disclose the existence of the property` TRUE (JUST FALSE) TRUE FALSE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING   -- they do not know
#ASSERT `s 83.1(1)(a) the person must disclose the existence of the property` TRUE (JUST FALSE) TRUE TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING   -- not a terrorist group
#ASSERT `s 83.1(1)(b) the person must disclose information about the transaction` (JUST TRUE) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.1(1)(b) the person must disclose information about the transaction` (JUST TRUE) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- no information about a transaction
#ASSERT `s 83.1(1)(b) the person must disclose information about the transaction` NOTHING TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.1(2) no criminal or civil proceedings lie against the person` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.1(2) no criminal or civil proceedings lie against the person` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- not in good faith
#TRACE `s 83.1(1) the duty to disclose` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the accused` DOES `s 83.1(1)(a) discloses the existence of the property to the Commissioner of the Royal Canadian Mounted Police or to the Director of the Canadian Security Intelligence Service` AT 1
    PARTY `the accused` DOES `s 83.1(1)(b) discloses information about a transaction or proposed transaction to the Commissioner of the Royal Canadian Mounted Police or to the Director of the Canadian Security Intelligence Service` AT 2   -- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 83.1(1) the duty to disclose` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the accused` DOES `s 83.1(1)(a) discloses the existence of the property to the Commissioner of the Royal Canadian Mounted Police or to the Director of the Canadian Security Intelligence Service` AT 1   -- EXPECT discloses information about a transaction or proposed transaction

-- ---- 83.11.
#ASSERT `s 83.11(1) the entity must determine whether it is in possession or control of the property` `s 83.11(1)(a) an authorized foreign bank within the meaning of section 2 of the Bank Act in respect of its business in Canada, or a bank to which that Act applies` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.11(1) the entity must determine whether it is in possession or control of the property` `s 83.11(1)(b) a cooperative credit society, savings and credit union or caisse populaire regulated by a provincial Act, or an association regulated by the Cooperative Credit Associations Act` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.11(1) the entity must determine whether it is in possession or control of the property` `s 83.11(1)(c) a foreign company within the meaning of subsection 2(1) of the Insurance Companies Act in respect of its insurance business in Canada` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.11(1) the entity must determine whether it is in possession or control of the property` `s 83.11(1)(c.1) a company, provincial company or society within the meaning of subsection 2(1) of the Insurance Companies Act` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.11(1) the entity must determine whether it is in possession or control of the property` `s 83.11(1)(c.2) a fraternal benefit society regulated by a provincial Act in respect of its insurance activities, or an insurance company or other entity engaged in the business of insuring risks that is regulated by a provincial Act` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.11(1) the entity must determine whether it is in possession or control of the property` `s 83.11(1)(d) a company to which the Trust and Loan Companies Act applies` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.11(1) the entity must determine whether it is in possession or control of the property` `s 83.11(1)(e) a trust company regulated by a provincial Act` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.11(1) the entity must determine whether it is in possession or control of the property` `s 83.11(1)(f) a loan company regulated by a provincial Act` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.11(1) the entity must determine whether it is in possession or control of the property` `s 83.11(1)(g) an entity authorized under provincial legislation to engage in the business of dealing in securities, or to provide portfolio management or investment counselling services` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.11(1) the entity must determine whether it is in possession or control of the property` `s 83.11(1) an entity of none of those kinds` EQUALS NOTHING
-- Monthly: the day of the last report is 15 January 2026, so the next is due 15 February 2026; from 31 January the day is clamped to 28 February 2026 (fork F-ccc3-10); a period of 14 days from 1 March 2026 is 15 March 2026.
#ASSERT `s 83.11(2) the day by which the next report is due` (Date 15 1 2026) NOTHING EQUALS Date 15 2 2026
#ASSERT `s 83.11(2) the day by which the next report is due` (Date 31 1 2026) NOTHING EQUALS Date 28 2 2026
#ASSERT `s 83.11(2) the day by which the next report is due` (Date 1 3 2026) (JUST 14) EQUALS Date 15 3 2026
#ASSERT `s 83.11(2) the report is complete` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- (a)
#ASSERT `s 83.11(2) the report is complete` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- (b), with the number and the total value
#ASSERT `s 83.11(2) the report is complete` FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- (b) without the number of persons, contracts or accounts
#ASSERT `s 83.11(2) the report is complete` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- (b) without the total value
#ASSERT `s 83.11(2) the report is complete` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- neither (a) nor (b)
#ASSERT `s 83.11(3) no criminal or civil proceedings lie against the person for the report` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.11(3) no criminal or civil proceedings lie against the person for the report` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#TRACE `s 83.11(2) the duty to report` 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `an organization` DOES `s 83.11(2)(a) reports that it is not in possession or control of any property referred to in subsection (1)` AT 30   -- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 83.11(2) the duty to report` 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `an organization` DOES `s 83.11(2)(b) reports that it is in possession or control of such property, with the number of persons, contracts or accounts involved and the total value of the property` AT 15   -- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 83.11(2) the duty to report` 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `an organization` DOES `s 83.11(2)(a) reports that it is not in possession or control of any property referred to in subsection (1)` AT 31   -- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 83.11(2) the duty to report` 30 AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 31)   -- EXPECT BREACH

-- ---- 83.12(1).
#ASSERT `s 83.12(1) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.12(1) the person is guilty of the offence` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.12(1) the person is guilty of the offence` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.12(1) the person is guilty of the offence` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 83.12(1) the class of the offence` EQUALS `an offence that the section makes both indictable and punishable on summary conviction`
#ASSERT `s 83.12(1) the punishments of the offence` EQUALS LIST (Punishment OF `by indictment`, (`imprisonment for a term of` `ten years`), `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`), (Punishment OF `on summary conviction`, (`imprisonment for a term of` `two years less a day`), `no imprisonment is stated`, (`a fine of` 100000), `no fine is stated`)
